silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_03_arrow_typing_contract_concrete_anchor_8#yonedareadabletrace silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaReadableTrace is The installed atom emits a Yoneda-readable trace. The observe arrow lands here. Trace populates Hom(Mittens, -). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Trace', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
